<title>USA: JFAX teams with Qualcomm, CompuServe.</title>
<headline>JFAX teams with Qualcomm, CompuServe.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>JFAX Personal Telecom said Monday it agreed to offer its facsimile and voice mail services for the Internet to Qualcomm Inc and CompuServe Inc.</p>
<p>No financial terms were disclosed.</p>
<p>Qualcomm said the agreement would allow the 18 million users of its Eudora Pro and Eudora Light software to set up virtual offices around the world via universal in-box capabilities.</p>
</text>
